From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nds-ports <nds-ports@localhost>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 07:10:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Copy memory fast on the DS

mem_nds.c replaces newlib's memcpy and memset, which copy a byte at a
time in Thumb mode, with word copies from ITCM.
---
 WinQuake/mem_nds.c | 94 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 94 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 WinQuake/mem_nds.c

diff --git a/WinQuake/mem_nds.c b/WinQuake/mem_nds.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1703051
--- /dev/null
+++ b/WinQuake/mem_nds.c
@@ -0,0 +1,94 @@
